-- Correct handle host sides on the seeded global policies (physical
-- fidelity pass): the v1 authorities mounted every handle on the right
-- stile. Policy rows are immutable, so the corrected authority lands as
-- v2 and the prep loader (ORDER BY version DESC) prefers it. Skipped
-- when the org's policy already carries pinned door rules.


